{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Due to factors such as war, the human population has sharply declined, leaving a group of survivors to reorganize without technology.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Under your leadership, can the population recover, or will it stagnate? The choices you make will determine their fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This demo includes the following playable content, featuring 66 building models and dozens of decorative models for landscaping.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playable content includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>    Chopping, gathering, planting, fishing, hunting, taming, trapping</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>    Animal husbandry, basic food processing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>    Mining, factory processing, electricity, shops</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>    Simple transportation, town upgrades, and more</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Partial gameplay features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fuel Production: When the environment is too cold, residents need fuel for warmth. Charcoal kilns can be built to produce charcoal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/extras/GGGG4.gif?t=1749831935\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animal Husbandry: Players can construct pastures and farms to raise animals. Animals can be obtained through hunting lodges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/extras/GGGG2.gif?t=1749831935\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farming: Players can grow crops for food, with different terrains supporting different types of crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/extras/GGGG3.gif?t=1749831935\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fishing: Build fishing docks along coastlines with fishery resources to dispatch fishing boats for harvesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/extras/GGGG1.gif?t=1749831935\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Town Upgrades: When the population and resources reach required levels, players can upgrade the town to unlock higher-tier technologies and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/extras/GGGG5.gif?t=1749831935\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay tuned for the full release!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814330?t=1749831935","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814330?t=1749831935","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/283a7040144e8aab36d93ae6c8da2b26d8747d70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749831935","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/283a7040144e8aab36d93ae6c8da2b26d8747d70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749831935","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Due to factors such as war, the human population has sharply declined, leaving a group of survivors to reorganize without technology.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Under your leadership, can the population recover, or will it stagnate? The choices you make will determine their fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This demo includes the following playable content, featuring 66 building models and dozens of decorative models for landscaping.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playable content includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>    Chopping, gathering, planting, fishing, hunting, taming, trapping</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>    Animal husbandry, basic food processing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>    Mining, factory processing, electricity, shops</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>    Simple transportation, town upgrades, and more</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Partial gameplay features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fuel Production: When the environment is too cold, residents need fuel for warmth. Charcoal kilns can be built to produce charcoal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/extras/GGGG4.gif?t=1749831935\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animal Husbandry: Players can construct pastures and farms to raise animals. Animals can be obtained through hunting lodges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/extras/GGGG2.gif?t=1749831935\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farming: Players can grow crops for food, with different terrains supporting different types of crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/extras/GGGG3.gif?t=1749831935\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fishing: Build fishing docks along coastlines with fishery resources to dispatch fishing boats for harvesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/extras/GGGG1.gif?t=1749831935\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Town Upgrades: When the population and resources reach required levels, players can upgrade the town to unlock higher-tier technologies and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/extras/GGGG5.gif?t=1749831935\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay tuned for the full release!</p>","developers":["kanyu Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3813160","name":"\u91cd\u5851\u6587\u660e Rebuilding Civilization"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814330/e2fac21b2a463e281907198854da72d6b79970d1/header.jpg?t=1749831935","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Any assets in the game belong to our studio, and no one is allowed to decompile them, otherwise they will bear legal consequences","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257155495,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155495/movie480.mp4?t=1749831933","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155495/movie_max.mp4?t=1749831933"},"name":"RebuildingCivilization","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155495/32f02d8e73a91eb23e43d3f1aebfd0a28091bbb0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749831933","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155495/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749831933","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155495/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749831933"}}],